crates/rmcp/src/transport/common/http_header.rs

The private POST implementation and necessary header/JSON helpers retain the
upstream protocol behavior. Modifications remove credential-bearing request URLs
and raw reflected non-protocol error bodies from diagnostics, retain typed error
categories, use public error constructors, and use the supported spelling of the
SSE stream constructor. GET and DELETE requests remain delegated to rmcp.
